<Placemark><name>Högl-dombhát (30.9 km, 636 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Högl-dombhát</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Rövid, kilátásos kör a Högl dombhátán, a Salzach-medence és a Berchtesgadeni-Alpok panorámájával. Pidingről a Johannishöglre kapaszkodsz, a dombtetőn Ulrichshögl kápolnája mellett haladsz, majd Aufhamon át ereszkedsz vissza. Délutáni rövid körnek tökéletes.<br/><br/>Táv: 30.9 km · Szint: 636 m · Max: 832 m · Idő: ~2.6 ó<br/>Nehézség: közepes · Értékelés: ★★★☆☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 56.6%, kemény murva 38.6%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 4.8%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~12 perc: Anger, Scheiterparkplatz | Vonattal: Piding (~6 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: A Johannishögl Berggasthof októberben hétköznap rövidebben tart nyitva.]]></description><styleUrl>#kozepes</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,472 12.88311,47.72749,471 12.88394,47.72772,471 12.88465,47.7287,469 12.88606,47.72973,468 12.88728,47.73071,466 12.8879,47.7317,465 12.88899,47.73286,463 12.8898,47.73392,464 12.8905,47.73518,463 12.89072,47.73556,462 12.89139,47.73623,461 12.88993,47.73717,462 12.8898,47.73724,462 12.8907,47.73798,461 12.88915,47.73896,460 12.88912,47.73899,460 12.89077,47.73974,459 12.8915,47.74003,459 12.89259,47.7408,460 12.89435,47.74174,460 12.89549,47.74227,459 12.89619,47.74363,458 12.89671,47.74455,459 12.89821,47.74558,458 12.90007,47.7463,458 12.90082,47.74653,458 12.89994,47.7476,458 12.90078,47.74854,460 12.90143,47.7482,456 12.90219,47.74862,453 12.9027,47.74944,456 12.90373,47.75021,456 12.90448,47.75045,455 12.90453,47.75088,456 12.90589,47.75197,455 12.90598,47.75204,454 12.9066,47.75269,453 12.9065,47.75281,453 12.90786,47.75393,453 12.90922,47.75506,452 12.9103,47.75597,452 12.90869,47.7569,451 12.90833,47.75711,451 12.90974,47.7582,451 12.91096,47.75919,452 12.91109,47.75968,451 12.91138,47.75982,451 12.91158,47.75971,451 12.91071,47.76005,451 12.91157,47.76068,451 12.91256,4