<Placemark><name>Untersberg-kör (54.8 km, 864 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Untersberg-kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>A környék egyik legszebb klasszikusa: az Untersberg teljes megkerülése. Hallthurmon át Bischofswiesenbe és Berchtesgadenbe, onnan az Almbachklamm és Marktschellenberg felé, majd St. Leonhardon, Grödigen és Fürstenbrunnon át Großgmain felé zárod a kört. Két országon át, sziklafalak alatt.<br/><br/>Táv: 54.8 km · Szint: 864 m · Max: 774 m · Idő: ~4.1 ó<br/>Nehézség: közepes · Értékelés: ★★★★★<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 71.6%, kemény murva 25.0%, laza/erdei 1.1%, ösvény 2.2%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~10 perc: Wanderparkplatz Hallthurm | Vonattal: Berchtesgaden Hbf (~30 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: Berchtesgaden–Marktschellenberg között a B305 rövid szakaszán forgalom van. Határátlépés Marktschellenbergnél – személyi igazolvány.]]></description><styleUrl>#kozepes</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88439,47.72655,479 12.88387,47.72612,482 12.88385,47.72585,484 12.8841,47.72577,485 12.88522,47.72601,493 12.8856,47.72597,496 12.8864,47.72517,511 12.88686,47.72389,525 12.88762,47.72328,529 12.88832,47.72314,529 12.88979,47.72329,526 12.89185,47.72328,519 12.89316,47.72324,517 12.89531,47.7235,519 12.8973,47.72377,523 12.89799,47.72391,525 12.89862,47.72331,529 12.89936,47.72231,535 12.89925,47.72223,535 12.90043,47.72125,538 12.89926,47.71998,543 12.8991,47.71977,544 12.90108,47.71936,543 12.90182,47.7192,543 12.90381,47.71899,539 12.90515,47.7188,537 12.9071,47.71814,544 12.90738,47.71807,545 12.9094,47.71781,550 12.9104,47.71763,553 12.91223,47.71708,558 12.91271,47.71687,559 12.91282,47.71634,561 12.91368,47.71623,565 12.91402,47.71498,579 12.91391,47.71388,588 12.91534,47.71271,603 12.91506,47.71252,605 12.91473,47.71255,609 12.9138,47.71153,624 12.91476,47.71117,631 12.91586,47.71035,638 12.91757,47.70955,645 12.91891,47.70884,651 12.91948,47.70819,660 12.91