<Placemark><name>Saalach–Mußbach kör (36.3 km, 615 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Saalach–Mußbach kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Csendes völgyi kör a Saalach mentén délre. A Saalachsee gátja után a régi völgyi utakon Jettenbergbe, majd a Mußbach erdei murvaútján kapaszkodsz, és a folyó túlsó partján gurulsz vissza. Kevés szint, sok murva – kezdőknek is jó.<br/><br/>Táv: 36.3 km · Szint: 615 m · Max: 677 m · Idő: ~3.0 ó<br/>Nehézség: közepes · Értékelés: ★★★☆☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 38.7%, kemény murva 54.8%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 6.5%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~8 perc: Parkplatz Seewirt, Thumsee | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall-Kirchberg (~3 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: A Saalach menti utat esőzés után helyenként elmossa a víz – ilyenkor maradj a B21 melletti kerékpárúton.]]></description><styleUrl>#kozepes</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88437,47.72662,478 12.88435,47.72641,479 12.88387,47.72612,481 12.8838,47.72566,482 12.88319,47.725,481 12.88225,47.72454,476 12.88132,47.72493,474 12.88082,47.72441,472 12.88023,47.72441,470 12.87903,47.72332,472 12.87791,47.7224,474 12.87719,47.72264,475 12.87621,47.72143,474 12.8759,47.72098,474 12.87513,47.71966,474 12.87491,47.71907,474 12.87325,47.71872,473 12.87301,47.71876,473 12.87369,47.71834,474 12.87385,47.71695,477 12.87384,47.71687,477 12.87315,47.71562,483 12.87208,47.71447,481 12.87038,47.71366,483 12.86914,47.71316,483 12.86816,47.71289,481 12.86759,47.71233,482 12.86607,47.7116,488 12.86511,47.7109,487 12.86329,47.71016,491 12.86279,47.70995,492 12.86192,47.70937,493 12.86173,47.70882,493 12.86192,47.70937,494 12.86132,47.70859,496 12.85974,47.7076,496 12.85827,47.70664,495 12.85742,47.70595,496 12.85629,47.70584,496 12.85449,47.70516,493 12.85432,47.70511,493 12.85346,47.70509,489 12.85305,47.70491,489 12.85275,47.70443,490 12.85321,47.70405,491 12.8531,47.70313,496 12.85269,47.70207,497 12.85166,47.70081,493 12.851