<Placemark><name>Loferer Alm és a Vorderkaserklamm (36.4 km, 967 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Loferer Alm és a Vorderkaserklamm</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Loferből a Loferer Alm hegyi útján kapaszkodsz fel a Loferer Steinberge alatti almvidékre (≈1300 m), majd vissza a völgybe, és St. Martinon át a Vorderkaserklamm szurdokához tekersz egy kiadós völgyi kitérőre. Rövid, de szintes.<br/><br/>Táv: 36.4 km · Szint: 967 m · Max: 1355 m · Idő: ~3.4 ó<br/>Nehézség: nehéz · Értékelés: ★★★★☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 62.4%, kemény murva 31.6%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 6.0%<br/>Indulás: Autóval ~30 perc: Lofer, Parkplatz Zentrum | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall Hbf (gyalog/bringával 0,5 km a szállodától)<br/>Október: A Loferer Alm felső része 1200 m felett: hó lehetséges. A Vorderkaserklamm és a büfé általában október közepéig nyitva.]]></description><styleUrl>#nehez</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.6953,47.58671,627 12.69462,47.58692,627 12.6935,47.58676,627 12.69348,47.58701,627 12.69286,47.58731,627 12.69175,47.5885,636 12.69184,47.58882,643 12.69353,47.5895,663 12.6935,47.59,668 12.69382,47.59052,677 12.69356,47.59138,686 12.69298,47.59208,696 12.6928,47.59353,718 12.69264,47.59394,722 12.69189,47.59402,730 12.69134,47.59382,734 12.69138,47.59464,743 12.691,47.59583,756 12.69059,47.59611,755 12.69055,47.59692,755 12.69022,47.59762,763 12.68933,47.59785,776 12.68996,47.59871,796 12.68799,47.5986,818 12.68755,47.59859,821 12.68656,47.59976,841 12.68649,47.59988,842 12.68665,47.60025,847 12.68837,47.60088,867 12.68898,47.60092,875 12.6889,47.60185,887 12.68782,47.60227,897 12.68747,47.60282,911 12.68688,47.60328,922 12.68677,47.60373,930 12.68641,47.60408,937 12.68645,47.60455,944 12.68575,47.60468,950 12.68544,47.60491,954 12.68562,47.60428,964 12.68458,47.60369,980 12.68295,47.60418,1001 12.68192,47.6041,1015 12.68051,47.60427,1030 12.6803,47.60463,1036 12.67935,47.60525,1053 12.67802,47.60464,1073 12.67687,47.60439,1080 12.67662,47.60456,1081 1